          %p
          %h3#section_Definitions Definitions
          %p In addition, there are judgments for the initialization operator for types and for terms:
          %ul
            %li
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Γ
