          %p The initialization operator has its own structural rules: type formation, term introduction, and equality reflection.
          %ul
            %li
              %p Formation and judgmental equality reflection rules for type definition:
              .maruku-equation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mfrac
                        %mrow
                          %mi Γ
                          %mo ⊢
                          %mi B
                          %mo ≔
                          %mi A
                          %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                          %mi{:mathvariant => "normal"} type
                        %mrow
                          %mi Γ
                          %mo ⊢
                          %mi B
                          %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                          %mi{:mathvariant => "normal"} type
                      %mspace{:width => "2em"}
                      %mfrac
                        %mrow
                          %mi Γ
                          %mo ⊢
                          %mi B
