            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Isabelle"} Isabelle
            are classical logics, and so require an additional axiom: the
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/law+of+excluded+middle"} law of excluded middle
